# hair/adult/mohawk_tuft: the Mohawk crest's tip: it stretches a pixel as the head drops and flattens as it rises (tuft keys)
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair mohawk
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys tuft
z 1

view D key down origin 0 0
|......aaaa......
|......adda......

view D key up origin 0 0
|................
|......----......
|.....aaeeaa.....

view U key down origin 0 0
|......aaaa......
|......adda......

view U key up origin 0 0
|................
|......----......
|.....aaddaa.....

# (the hurt flinch facing sideways: the crest and the knot hold still)
view R key down origin 0 0
|.

view L key down origin 0 0
|.

# (the sword's fierce face: the crest and the knot as they are)
view D key fierce origin 0 0
|.

# capped (under a hat, a hood or a helm; a circlet shows the whole style): the style kept inside the headwear
view D key down when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view D key up when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view U key down when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view U key up when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view R key down when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view L key down when capped,!circlet replace
|.

view D key fierce when capped,!circlet replace
|.
